# Scenario name
msgid "Kessler"
msgstr "Kessler"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"Save the global satellite network by catching space debris and prevent the "
"Kessler Syndrome! This is a beginner scenario initially created to be played "
"by a crew of school kids. It still assumes general knowledge about operating "
"the stations, so a previous tutorial session or on-site introduction is "
"recommended. The officer(s) on relay&science or on operations should be able "
"to read fluently."
msgstr "Save the global satellite network by catching space debris and prevent the Kessler Syndrome! This is a beginner scenario initially created to be played by a crew of school kids. It still assumes general knowledge about operating the stations, so a previous tutorial session or on-site introduction is recommended. The officer(s) on relay&science or on operations should be able to read fluently."

